ered around their loggers (World Radio League, Wavelog, Log4OM), eQSL/LoTW/QRZ and POTA/SOTA activator circles\",\n  \"problem\": [\n    \"QSL cards for ham radio contacts, one card per QSO, rendered from the ADIF log record (call, date, UTC, band/MHz, mode, RST, grid)\"\n  ],\n  \"sources\": [\n    \"https://community.worldradioleague.com/t/qsl-card-generator/13739\",\n    \"https://community.worldradioleague.com/t/qsl-card-generator/13739?page=2\",\n    \"https://community.worldradioleague.com/t/auto-qsl-card/\",\n    \"https://www.adif.org/316/ADIF_316.htm\",\n    \"https://github.com/s53zo/ADIF-to-QSL-label\",\n    \"https://cq.sk/en/adif-to-qsl-label/\",\n    \"https://docs.wavelog.org/user-guide/qsl/qsl-postcard-designer/\",\n    \"https://digiqsl.com/features\",\n    \"https://amateurradio.com/qsling-made-easy\"\n  ],\n  \"solution\": [\n    \"Ham Radio QSL Card: describe the ONE concept this template teaches, in one line, for the Templates page.\"\n  ],\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"command\": \"m0saic make @one-a-day/community/qsl-card/v1 --template-repo . -w 1280 -h 720 -o out.png\",\n    \"try\": []\n  },\n  \"timeline\": {\n    \"source\": \"runner\",\n    \"phases\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"scout\",\n        \"startMs\": 0,\n        \"durMs\": 187402,\n        \"calls\": 29,\n        \"tokens\": 2732923,\n        \"costUsd\": 1.3,\n        \"tools\": \"Bash 16, WebSearch 11, ToolSearch 1\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"plan\",\n        \"startMs\": 187417,\n        \"durMs\": 235946,\n        \"calls\": 7,\n        \"tokens\": 650247,\n        \"costUsd\": 0.73,\n        \"tools\": \"Bash 6, Write 1\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"costBasis\": \"reported\"\n  }\n};\n\nexport const QslCardV1 = defineMosaicTemplate<QslCardProps>({\n  id: asTemplateId(ID),\n  label: \"2026-10-03 · Ham Radio QSL Card\",\n  version: 1,\n  description: \"Ham Radio QSL Card: describe the ONE concept this template teaches, in one line, for the Templates page.\",\n  capabil